Host-memory registration optimizations: A: pin user pages in batches of 512: pages that are already
mapped with pin_user_pages_fast(FOLL_NOFAULT) where FOLL_NOFAULT exists (Linux 5.16+ or a backport),
the rest with the upstream locked call. Refuses to build without pin_user_pages() (no FOLL_GET fallback).
NVIDIA open-gpu-kernel-modules 575.64.05, commit d89031330084ad34dbfe15997454a4bb1674e0b1.

